WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.022
- [Narrator] Most people know about

00:00:02.022 --> 00:00:04.368
the world's famous Cuban cigars right?

00:00:04.368 --> 00:00:07.002
But what most people do not
know about is a very curious

00:00:07.002 --> 00:00:11.252
profession that's essential
to the cigar factories.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.967
(Lucio speaking in Spanish)

00:00:19.038 --> 00:00:22.121
(upbeat Latin music)

00:00:40.596 --> 00:00:41.643
- [Narrator] Here's how it works.

00:00:41.643 --> 00:00:44.520
Everyday, Lucio Cambs Peña,
wakes up early in the morning

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.035
and walks to H.Upman cigar factory

00:00:47.035 --> 00:00:48.505
where he sets up and starts reading to

00:00:48.505 --> 00:00:50.577
an audience of cigar rollers.

00:00:50.577 --> 00:00:52.859
He reads different things
like the news and magazines,

00:00:52.859 --> 00:00:56.442
but most importantly,
works of literature.

00:00:58.407 --> 00:01:01.074
(playful music)

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:21.667
(Lucio speaking Spanish)

00:02:00.543 --> 00:02:03.293
(playful music)

